        <mxCell id="qQ92Vg_JtF6BG2kjJf7Z-1" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Known Limitations&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;Solution is not covered by &quot;Shield Advanced&quot; and &quot;Palo&amp;nbsp; Alto firewall&quot; protections, but this is a trade off to achieve mTLS.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Terraform has limitation on automating attaching additional application specific rules to WebACL.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws/issues/39291&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fillColor=#ffcc99;strokeColor=#36393d;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="wpx-xS0hVz5jo0oU1wxI-3">
          <mxGeometry x="7" y="1440" width="810" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qQ92Vg_JtF6BG2kjJf7Z-2" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Additional notes&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;When the CAs in the trust store are rotated, API gateway will need to be redeployed with new trust store (new S3 file and/or version). Shared service team will need to update the bucket with new CAs and notify the ops for redeployment of applications.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Ensure proper tagging for proper attachment of WebACLs from the central Firewall Manager service.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;ALB was a good choice as proxy with much less overhead but couldn&#39;t be utilized because the mTLS offered by ALB doesn&#39;t support whitelisting of specific certificates nor the ability to achieve it via a custom lambda authorizer.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;HTTP API couldn&#39;t be used for lack of support of WAF&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="wpx-xS0hVz5jo0oU1wxI-3">
          <mxGeometry x="837" y="1440" width="780" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
